div.p:
This Fast Healthcare Interoperability Resources (FHIR)® Implementation Guide (IG) is designed to facilitate the standardized exchange of healthcare information in Botswana; 
specifically the handling of laboratory orders in both OpenMRS and PIMS systems to and from the national laboratory system, IPMS. 
The guide is crafted for Botswana's Health Information Exchange (HIE) and provides a structured approach to managing lab orders.
